  "excerpt": "Low-poly slot machine 3D model with full rig and FBX format.\nDesigned for real-time animation and interactive scenes.",
  "contentText": "This is a low poly slot machine 3d model with clean topology and a fully functional mechanical rig. The asset is designed for real-time use and supports basic animated interactions such as lever pulls and spinning reels. Low Poly Slot Machine 3D Model Technical Details Asset type: Mechanical prop Topology and polycount: Quads (6,632 polygons) UVs and Texture: Yes (texture atlas) Rig and Animation: Yes (mechanical rig) File formats: FBX (.fbx) Like this post? ( ´◔ ω◔`) ノシ Support:   Buy Me a Coffee  | Patreon  | GitHub  | Gumroad   |  YouTube",
